Module parity.aliasReceiver.

Define Fahrer has alter as Int.

Define Level as one of Hoch, Niedrig.

Type Fz as Fahrer.

Type L as Level.

Rule punkte given s as L, produce Int:
  Match s:
    When Hoch, Return 2.
    When Niedrig, Return 1.

Rule alterVon given x as Fz, produce Int:
  Return x.alter.
